# PromptForge — Environment Variables
# This file is OPTIONAL. The app works fully without any of these.
#
# These two variables only power the "X people online" live counter
# shown on the landing page. If you don't set these, that counter
# simply won't display — nothing else breaks.
#
# Get a free Redis instance at https://upstash.com

UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL=
UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN=

# ---
# IMPORTANT: AI provider API keys (OpenAI, Anthropic, Google, Groq, etc.)
# are NOT configured here. Each end user enters their own key directly
# inside the app (API Keys page). This keeps your deployment free of
# any AI usage costs — your users pay their own provider directly.
